[00:06.50]in higher education in China from 1990 to 2020.
[00:11.46]Between 1990 and 2010,
[00:16.46]the percentage increased steadily from 3.4% to 24.2%,
[00:22.28]a rise of about 21%.
[00:26.36]It has risen markedly from 24.2% to 51.6% between 2010 and 2020.
[00:35.92]The contributing factors that brought the afore-mentioned 
[00:39.92]changes could be classified as follows.
[00:43.84]Above all,
[00:44.78]with the improvement of living standards,
[00:46.56]there has been a great change in people’s ideas about education,
[00:50.22]and they are becoming increasingly aware of the necessity 
[00:53.22]of receiving higher education.
